# The read must FAIL: Surelog reports the seven ILLEGAL lines in dut.sv -- an
# integer generate-loop index (CP0369), a nested loop reusing its enclosing
# loop's genvar (CP0349), a parameter with
# no default and no value (EL0554), overrides of a port-list parameter after
# `localparam` and of a generate-block parameter (EL0553), a real member of
# a packed struct (UH0746) and a self-containing struct (UH0747).  The exact
# count pins it to those: declared, inline and shadowing genvars,
# positional / named / defparam values, and a forward typedef
# completed without recursion, must stay silent.
logger -expect error "Surelog reported 0 fatal, 0 syntax and 7 other error" 1
read_sv -nonote -noinfo -nowarning dut.sv
